 * returns. You would most commonly use this to set the
 * <b>PDO::ATTR_CURSOR</b> value to
 * <b>PDO::CURSOR_SCROLL</b> to request a scrollable cursor.
 * Some drivers have driver specific options that may be set at
 * prepare-time.
